{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-1", "avgTag": "行動後", "storyName": "工作與時日", "storyInfo": "在緹緹的提議下，工地上爭吵的雙方解決了糾紛。一切順利，但原本應該幫大家統籌與調解的帕拉斯人在哪裡？\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g7_firsttemple", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$farce_intro", "key": "$farce_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside", "channel": "1", "loop": "true", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "搬不搬！", "name": "果農代表"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不搬！", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "搬不搬！", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不！搬！", "name": "果農代表"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好、好有氣勢的辯論！不愧是傳承英雄血脈的米諾斯人！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃……就是沒什麼實際的內容。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩邊都在扯著嗓子大喊，根本不知道他們在吵什麼。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在雅賽努斯航線修改一事上，果農跟我們神殿的工人積怨已久，都在氣頭上。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，真是慚愧，怎麼能讓隨便拉來的遊客解決我們自己人的糾紛呢，他們吵成這樣連我都聽不懂……", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_proud", "layer": 1.0, "x": 250.0, "y": 150.0}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#8$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果只是想聽懂，哼哼……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#8$2"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹，別給自己找麻煩。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#8$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“隨便拉來的遊客”剛好想到了一個辦法。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#8$2"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喂！小妹妹，不要往吵架的人群裡跑啊，小心被他們波及受傷！", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_smashtable", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "2"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_bowl_smash", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "4"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "69_i03"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.0, "yScaleFrom": 1.0, "xScaleTo": 0.8, "yScaleTo": 0.8, "duration": 45.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_cnstrctnck", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "神殿的工匠代表和庇護果農的義務兵各執一詞、面紅耳赤，絲毫沒注意到一對黑色的尖耳朵從石桌下探了出來。"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小個子菲林女孩一躍而出，笑咪咪地拉過兩人的手，把他們的手交握在一起。"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "事件核心的雙方代表一時沒反應過來，被她扯得失去重心，雙雙趴在石桌上，齊齊看向這個開朗的外鄉人。"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是誰帶來的小女孩，跑到神殿玩家家酒嗎？", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，你的無理取鬧連外邦人都看不下去了，真丟雅賽努斯人的臉。", "name": "果農代表"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別趁機火上加油！", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喂，這是我們米諾斯人的事，不需要一個什麼都不懂的外國小妹妹教我們怎麼和好。", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "誰說要讓你們和好了？", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？", "name": "工匠代表&果農代表"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不面對問題，是沒辦法解決問題的。就算現在重修舊好，又能維持多久呢？", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再說了，入鄉隨俗。米諾斯盛傳激昂的英雄史詩和動人的故事，其中記載著無數前人的智慧，應該不需要我教各位怎麼解決問題吧？", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "相傳米諾斯最善戰的英雄海格斯武藝高超，令所有外敵聞風喪膽。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但面對米諾斯同鄉，哪怕對方再冒犯，他也不會直接出手，而是以比腕力的方式點到為止。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "效仿英雄用力氣定輸贏？不錯，省了那些口舌之辯！", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我還沒說完。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "又相傳，有一位沉默的英雄，他年輕時熱情而大膽，曾是被鮮花簇擁的飛揚少年。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但命運讓他知曉了一個不應讓任何人知道的秘密，從此他緘口不言，沉默了三十年。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，大力神海格斯的傳說耳熟能詳，但“沉默的英雄”？少騙我們了！", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，這是小時候父親講給我聽的米諾斯故事，確實不是什麼有名的典故，太適合用來舉例所以順口說了出來——", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳，總之！我建議效仿米諾斯先賢，比腕力定輸贏。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過要加一個小小的條件——不管怨氣有多大，只有贏的人才有資格說話。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，從來沒聽過這種規矩。", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是不善言詞，還是四肢無力？", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "廢話少說，比就比。", "name": "工匠代表"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿，那第一屆第一神殿比腕力大賽——", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正式開始！", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "1", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g7_firsttemple", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_bowl_smash", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "1"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_masses_cheer", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "4"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 2.0, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇，沒想到那個義務兵看起來瘦弱，技巧卻很嫻熟，趁大塊頭卸力的瞬間反擊，漂亮！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你——", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "憋著，輸家不准說話！", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "石材堵在渡口，新採的蘋果一籃都運不出去，而且種植區完全被山峰的陰影遮擋，未熟透的蘋果根本照不到太陽，這樣下去就要歉收了！", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一比零，再來。", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_smashtable", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "2"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_masses_cheer", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "4"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 2.0, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇，這身肌肉果然不是白長的，看來背大理石對人類來說是不錯的運動啊。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "蘋果得先搬走我們才能運石材吧？而且我們重建第一神殿是受到了米諾斯眾英雄的感召，如果因此拖延了重建，你承擔得起這個責任嗎！", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一比一，再來！", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "蘋果採收和運送石材……原來是這樣。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好看好看，米諾斯人真是有趣。不過再比幾輪下去，等雙方選手都沒力了，就沒有什麼觀賞價值了……", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#2$1"}, {"id": 133, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_masses_cheer", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "4"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 2.0, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，他們怎麼停下來了？", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他們意識到了，比腕力原本就不是為了決出勝負，而是為了讓他們有機會聽對方說話。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "被憤怒蒙蔽雙眼的時候，耳朵也會失靈，即使是簡單的事情也會變得複雜，更不用說要化解長久以來的積怨了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看不出來，你的心思竟然這麼細膩……", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但解決完了情緒，你又該怎麼解決真正的問題呢？", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼……呼……", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼……呼……", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看來是個平手呢。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#4$2"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "外國小妹妹……", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "叫我緹緹吧。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，緹緹，我們也不想耽誤果農的工作。", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "參與重建的人雖多，但大家都只在自己喜歡的時間和區域採石，進度堪憂。昨天我一個人從山上背了十五噸大理石材，依舊不夠。", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "道理我們都懂，但蘋果並不會善解人意。", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，既要增加採石效率，又要讓蘋果能獲得足夠的日曬……既然如此，為什麼不採取折衷的辦法？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼意思？", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 181, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "把擋住種植區陽光的那座山峰挖空，不就好了嘛。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈哈！好一個“折衷”，這是我聽過最異想天開的解決方法了！", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過有點意思。", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "算是一點個人的興趣愛好，我來雅賽努斯的路上，順便研究了一下城區規劃和自然環境。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在遮擋種植區日曬的山峰並非主峰，且頂端土質鬆軟，底下則是大片的大理石岩層，應該是個不錯的採石場。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的意思是夷平山峰，這樣就算不改航線，種植區也能曬到太陽？這可能嗎……？", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，果農們也要加入採石的隊伍。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "補充人員是增加採石效率的最快方法，另外還要集合分散在各處山峰的工匠們一起採石。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是工匠先生一個人一天就能背十五噸大理石材……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夷平山峰並非不可能。", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "重建神殿本就是雅賽努斯人集體通過的提議，如果還能順便解決日曬的問題，皆大歡喜。", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我現在就回去跟果農們商量！", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "太好了，問題解決！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多謝你，緹緹。", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "太客氣了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然神殿還未修建完成，但你們的手藝真是巧奪天工……我越來越好奇第一神殿的負責人是什麼樣子了！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃，說到這個，現在倒還有一個問題沒有解決。", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#4$2"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你想見的那位重建神殿的第一倡議人，帕拉斯小姐，昨晚就失蹤了。", "name": "工匠代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2087_1#1$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_question", "layer": 1.0, "y": 180.0}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_question", "layer": 2.0, "x": 20.0, "y": 200.0}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_question", "layer": 3.0, "x": 70.0, "y": 180.0}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "31_g1_luo_park", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“……從前的歡愉屬於我們兩個，永恆的寧靜卻獨歸於你。”", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“赫里亞山間的清風，阿涅斯平原上的溪流，你澄澈的雙眼已無法映出這些美景；”", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“夜晚的安眠與白日的閒暇，再也進不了我的內心……”", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一別七年了，伊薩科斯吾友。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "高大的戰士將手中的仙客來花束放在潔白的墓碑前。"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他的動作輕柔，幾片白色的花瓣卻依然掉落在地。"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你來晚了。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "附近的馱獸牧場景色宜人，我只是路過。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "隨你用什麼藉口，你知道自己放不下。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也是。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在雅賽努斯生活了五年，你從不光顧恩底彌翁神殿。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你帶著伊薩科斯的血衣來拜訪我，那是你第一次踏進神殿，也是最後一次。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不需要英雄的指引。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你還在做同一個夢，不是嗎……？你責怪自己送伊薩科斯渡了那條河，然後他就那麼死在了戰場上。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那條河的上游被薩爾貢人興建的水壩攔截，它現在只會在我的夢中奔流。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它為我的家鄉送來了赫里亞山巔融化的雪水，也送來了他……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊薩科斯是我為數不多可以交心的友人，他從不忌憚我的身分和“天賦”。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他的家族飽受戰火餘熱的燎燒，他的父親頹唐了一輩子，他卻不願那樣。九年前領受神諭的時候，他的眼睛泛著雀躍的光……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無論結局如何，他認識了你，另一位可以依靠、情同兄弟的友人。贊索斯先生，他可曾入夢，告訴你無需再為他掛懷？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "解讀夢境是你的生活，悼亡和銘記是我的。我會以自己的方式平息怒火。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是贊索斯先生，戰爭已經結束了。薩爾貢已經與我們簽訂了互不侵擾的協議，這次薩爾貢使節來訪也是一種表態。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，我當然清楚，里底婭甚至還裝模作樣地“敲打”了我。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雅賽努斯歷史上第一個全民公投選出的理事官，她不用再受議事廳和祭司們牽制，全權負責外交和部分公共事務管理……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她也沒少給你添麻煩吧？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "恩底彌翁神殿暫未受到牽連，但一些邊緣的神職人員和他們所屬神殿的職能正在被淡化，再加上……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克瑞斯拉第一神殿即將落成，理應安排一場由祭司主導的戲劇儀式，呼喚英雄克瑞斯拉進入神殿，庇佑米諾斯。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在，安排民眾演出戲劇的工作由理事官辦公室代為負責。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但前幾天，我與里底婭理事官商議此事時，她雖答應，卻在選擇劇目的議題上閃爍其詞……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，在她眼裡，無論是祭司還是那些傳統儀式，都是為米諾斯旅遊業添磚加瓦的擺設。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你對戲劇儀式必須選用古典戲劇的堅持，只會被她視作議事廳的祭司在向她示威。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道行政改革或許對如今的米諾斯而言不可避免，但……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 319, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "總有些東西不會變，也不能變。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "里底婭在行政權方面的小心思與我無關，但若是來訪的薩爾貢人包藏禍心，我不會坐視不管。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 324, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐，我本就是一名與“英雄”無緣的感染者，現在也不再需要神諭的指引，但我仍舊會做夢。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1"}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果我告訴你，我跟九年前的伊薩科斯一樣，夢到了一條染血的河流……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這次，你會給出什麼樣的解讀呢？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 329, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯先生！", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "渡口還有工作，我的徒弟在等我，失陪了。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g1_rivercrossing", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹，你真是熱心。不但幫我們解決了與果農的矛盾，現在還願意陪我們一起找帕拉斯小姐。", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 355, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小事啦，再說了，我也想快點見到那位重建神殿的倡議人。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最後一次見到帕拉斯小姐的地方，是渡口？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 358, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯。", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 360, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "昨天晚上，帕拉斯小姐還坐在碼頭，一邊喝酒，一邊對著遠處的荷謨伊山喃喃自語。", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 361, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "自重建神殿以來，她為我們解決了很多問題。雖然她並不在雅賽努斯的神殿供職，很多台前工作是恩底彌翁神殿的卡珊卓拉小姐負責……", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但分工、採購，甚至打點關係，都是她獨自一人在我們尚未注意到的時候悄悄完成的。", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 363, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#4$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來如此，這樣一位穩重的負責人突然失蹤，確實讓人很擔心……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#4$2"}, {"id": 365, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈……這個嘛，其實也不是第一次了。", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 367, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對了，差點忘了問最重要的事，這位帕拉斯小姐到底長什麼樣子？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 369, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她是一位小個子的豐蹄女性，總是一副睡不醒的樣子，頭頂上還有一朵小花。", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 371, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小花……唔，是不是只有兩片葉子，花瓣紅得連皺褶都看不到的那種？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 373, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對對對，你怎麼知道？", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 375, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你說的花，是不是長那個樣子的啊？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 377, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "工匠隨緹緹指的方向看去，一朵小紅花正插在不遠處的蘋果堆中，左搖右擺。"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真的耶……不過，這不是果農們運蘋果的箱子嗎？怎麼還開花了？", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 384, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不對，裡面有什麼東西！快躲開，緹緹！", "name": "工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 388, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_woodenbox_apple_overturn"}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 2.0, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 1.0, "g": 1.0, "b": 1.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "69_i13"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xFrom": 60.0, "xTo": 0.0, "yTo": 0.0, "duration": 25.0, "xScaleFrom": 1.05, "yScaleFrom": 1.05, "xScaleTo": 0.8, "yScaleTo": 0.8, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "木箱彷彿擁有意識一般突然“甦醒”，熟透了的蘋果傾瀉而出，鋪滿了碼頭，滾落到清澈的特爾斐運河裡。"}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "懶散的豐蹄從果實堆成的寢床中滑了出來，被刺眼的天光照得直皺眉頭，下意識地揉了揉眼睛。"}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕、帕拉斯小姐？", "name": "工匠"}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喂！快來人，不用借船了，我們找到帕拉斯小姐了！", "name": "工匠"}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這就是那位穩重的負責人、提出重建神殿的倡議者、極得民心的英雄人物——帕拉斯小姐？", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "跟我想像的完全不一樣欸……", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹好奇地靠近倒在地上的女孩。"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她想從對方的雙角上找出歷戰的缺口和磨損；探究她的武器究竟是何種構造，是否能支撐獨特的源石技藝……"}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "甚至想觸碰她頭頂那朵神秘的小花，判斷那是否為眾英雄的賜福。"}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但緹緹沒有感知到任何屬於英雄的特殊之處，只是聞到了一陣又一陣蘋果的甜香。"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "翻倒在地上的人似乎被緹緹吵醒，喃喃出聲，緹緹側耳去聽。"}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "山……荷謨伊山……", "name": "帕拉斯"}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "西側的山峰……挪平……不擋陽光……", "name": "帕拉斯"}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……得告訴果農和工人……還差什麼……", "name": "帕拉斯"}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對……蘋果酒……本來就該一起喝……", "name": "帕拉斯"}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夷平山峰解決日曬的問題？原來她跟我想到了一樣的解決方法……甚至在夢裡還想著重建神殿的事情？", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "噗……誰說英雄只能是身強力壯的將領呢？我怎麼忘了，這裡不是薩爾貢，而是米諾斯啊。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 417, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 419, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 1.0, "g": 1.0, "b": 1.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 421, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 423, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g1_rivercrossing", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 425, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#21$1", "posfrom": "0,-50", "posto": "0,0", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 2.5}}, {"id": 428, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 429, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，誰……？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#21$1"}, {"id": 430, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 431, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "終於見面了，提出重建克瑞斯拉第一神殿的倡議人，帕拉斯小姐。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 432, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是薩爾貢使節團大使，梅捷緹克緹-娜蘇圖-瑪夏耶爾。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 433, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#21$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 434, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#21$1"}, {"id": 435, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 436, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_matter", "layer": 1.0, "x": 60.0, "y": 180.0}}, {"id": 437, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 438, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 439, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "朋友們都叫我緹緹，這樣稱呼我就好了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 440, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 441, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 442, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 443, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 444, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 445, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}